    <b>Calendar Registration Open</b><br>
    <font size=1><b>Date:</b> Sunday, February 17 @ 13:30:00 EST<br><b>Topic:</b> News/Annoucements<br><br>
    </center><font size=2>
    If you check under the Calendar menu youll see "Calendar Registraion". We have decided to make it a requirement that you are registered to post on the Calendar, this way you will be able to edit or delete your own posts.<br /><br />We will however not be making it required to register for about two weeks or so, this should give all partys ample time to register and get thier affairs in order.<br /><br />Registration will be guild based. Your username will be your guild, and the password will be given to the guild leader(or whomever they choose to sign thier guild up and run these things) and they in turn can decide who else(if anyone) gets access to thier username amongst themselves. <br /><br />In the case of guild Alliances, we ask that only one username be registered for the entire alliance, and then if guilds within the alliance can raid solo and want to register seperatly they may. The only case where registration will be individual would be in the case of people who habitually conduct open raids indepent of any guild.<br><br>
